reads","Linux threads"],"correct_answer":"POSIX Pthreads\nWin32 threads\nJava threads","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u5","target_id":45,"content":{"question":"多執行緒程式設計的好處中，下列哪一項與使用者介面特別相關？","options":["響應性","可擴展性","資源共享","經濟性"],"correct_answer":"響應性","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u5","target_id":46,"content":{"question":"Which of the following statements about Parallelism and Concurrency are correct?","options":["A multicore system can provide parallelism","Concurrency means a system can support the progression of more than one task at the same time","Parallelism means a system can execute more than one task simultaneously","A single-core system can provide concurrency"],"correct_answer":"A multicore system can provide parallelism\nConcurrency means a system can support the progression of more than one task at the same time\nParallelism means a system can execute more than one task simultaneously\nA single-core system can provide concurrency","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u5","target_id":47,"content":{"question":"多執行緒伺服器架構的優點包含?","options":["執行緒創建比程序創建更輕量級","當一個執行緒被阻塞時,其他執行緒可以繼續執行","伺服器可以同時服務多個客戶端請求","程式碼更難以理解"],"correct_answer":"執行緒創建比程序創建更輕量級\n當一個執行緒被阻塞時,其他執行緒可以繼續執行\n伺服器可以同時服務多個客戶端請求","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u5","target_id":48,"content":{"question":"下列哪些作業系統採用 One-to-One 模型?","options":["Windows NT/XP/2000","Linux","Solaris Green Threads","Solaris 9 和更高版本"],"correct_answer":"Windows NT/XP/2000\nLinux\nSolaris 9 和更高版本","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u5","target_id":49,"content":{"question":"Which multithreading model maps many user-level threads to a single kernel thread?","options":["Many-to-Many","Two-level","Many-to-One","One-to-One"],"correct_answer":"Many-to-One","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u5","target_id":50,"content":{"question":"[__1__] refers to a system''s ability to support the progression of more than one task at the same time.(Please answe