 tasks are involved in the Dispatcher module?","options":["Switching to user mode","Selecting the next process to run","Switching context","Jumping to the proper location in the user program to restart that program"],"correct_answer":"Switching to user mode\nSwitching context\nJumping to the proper location in the user program to restart that program","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":10,"content":{"question":"分派器（Dispatcher）模組的工作包含將CPU控制權交給排程器所選擇的程序，這涉及 ________、切換到使用者模式，以及跳轉到使用者程式的適當位置。（請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白）","options":[],"correct_answer":"context switch","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":11,"content":{"question":"分派延遲（Dispatch latency）指的是什麼？","options":["中斷處理所需的時間","將一個程序停止並啟動另一個程序所需的時間","完成 I/O 作業所需的時間","排程器做出決策所需的時間"],"correct_answer":"將一個程序停止並啟動另一個程序所需的時間","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":12,"content":{"question":"當一個程序從執行中狀態切換到就緒狀態時，排程是屬於 ____________ 類型。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"preemptive","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":13,"content":{"question":"CPU排程的決策通常發生在下列哪些情況？","options":["程序從執行中狀態切換到等待中狀態","程序從執行中狀態切換到就緒狀態","程序從等待中狀態切換到就緒狀態","行程終止"],"correct_answer":"程序從執行中狀態切換到等待中狀態\n程序從執行中狀態切換到就緒狀態\n程序從等待中狀態切換到就緒狀態\n行程終止","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":14,"content":{"question":"[__1__] is the time it takes for the scheduler in a real-time system to take the current process off the CPU and switch to another.(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word)","options":[],"correct_answer":"dispatch latency","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":15,"content":{"question":"什麼是 Little''s Formula (n = λ x W) 中的 n？","options":["平均服務時間(Average service time)","平均到達率","平均佇列長度","平均等待時間"],"correct_answer":"平均佇列長度","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":16,"content":{"question":"________ 是 Little''s Formula (n = λ x W) 中的 λ，代表進入