utilization","Minimize response time"],"correct_answer":"Maximize throughput\nMinimize turnaround time\nMaximize CPU utilization\nMinimize response time","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":26,"content":{"question":"CPU排程的核心目標是什麼？","options":["降低CPU使用率","最大化CPU利用率","最大化I/O等待時間","最小化程式碼複雜度"],"correct_answer":"最大化CPU利用率","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":27,"content":{"question":"CPU 排程的目的是在 ____________ 系統中最大化CPU利用率。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"multiprogramming","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":28,"content":{"question":"Which scheduling algorithm can lead to the ''convoy effect''?","options":["First-Come, First-Served (FCFS)","Round Robin (RR)","Shortest-Job-First (SJF)","Priority scheduling"],"correct_answer":"First-Come, First-Served (FCFS)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":29,"content":{"question":"先到先服務（FCFS）排程的特性是什麼？","options":["簡單且易於理解","可能導致「護航效應」","適用於即時系統","等待時間總是最小的"],"correct_answer":"簡單且易於理解\n可能導致「護航效應」","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":30,"content":{"question":"________ 排程演算法可能導致護航效應，即所有其他程序都等待一個長程序完成。\n（請用英文縮寫回答且用大寫字母）","options":[],"correct_answer":"FCFS","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":31,"content":{"question":"The [__1__] effect occurs when a short process is blocked by one or more long processes.(Please answer in lowercase English)","options":[],"correct_answer":"convoy","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":32,"content":{"question":"The ________ scheduling algorithm is widely used for its simplicity but can lead to the \"convoy effect.\" (Please answer in lowercase English with full name, connecting letters with hyphens)","options":[],"correct_answer":"first-come first-served","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":33,"content":{"question":"Which scheduling algorithm is considered optimal because it provides the minimum average waiting time for a given set of processes?","options":["Shortest-Job-First (SJF)","First-Come, First-Served (FCFS)","Round Robin (RR)","Priority scheduling"],"correct_answer":"Shortest-Job-First (SJF)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":34,"content":{"question":"短工作優先（SJF）排程的優點包含哪些？","options":["易於實現","適合即時系統","給定程序集的最小平均等待時間","可以預測下一個 CPU burst 的長度"],"correct_answer":"給定程序集的最小平均等待時間","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":35,"content":{"question":"最短工作優先（SJF）排程演算法的優點是它能最小化平均 ________ 時間。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"waiting","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":36,"content":{"question":"The ________ scheduling algorithm is optimal because it provides the minimum average waiting time for a given set of processes. (Please answer in lowercase English, connecting letters with hyphens)","options":[],"correct_answer":"shortest-job-first","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":37,"content":{"question":"Which preemptive scheduling algorithm is the preemptive version of SJF?","options":[],"correct_answer":"Shortest Remaining Time First","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":38,"content":{"question":"短剩餘時間優先 (SRTF) 是哪一種排程演算法的搶佔式版本？","options":["先到先服務 (FCFS)","短工作優先 (SJF)","輪轉 (RR)","優先權排程"],"correct_answer":"短工作優先 (SJF)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":39,"content":{"question":"最短剩餘時間優先（SRTF）是 [__1__] 演算法的搶佔式版本。(請用英文縮寫回答 且用大寫字母)","options":[],"correct_answer":"SJF","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":40,"content":{"question":"關於估計下一個CPU爆發長度，可以採用哪些方法？","options":["使用過去CPU爆發長度的指數平均","設定 α=1 表示只考慮最後一個 burst","詢問使用者","使用恆定值"],"correct_answer":"使用過去CPU爆發長度的指數平均\n設定 α=1 表示只考慮最後一個 burst\n詢問使用者","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":41,"content":{"question":"迴圈排程（RR）演算法中，每個程序獲得一小段 CPU 時間的單位稱為？","options":["時間單位","時間區塊","時間片 (Time quantum)","時間週期"],"correct_answer":"時間片 (Time quantum)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":42,"content":{"question":"In the Round Robin (RR) algorithm, the unit of a small amount of CPU time given to each process is called a ____________ .(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word)","options":[],"correct_answer":"time quantum","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":43,"content":{"question":"當迴圈排程（RR）中的時間片（q）非常大時，該演算法的行為會趨近於哪種排程？","options":["多級隊列(Multilevel queue)","先到先服務 (FCFS)","短工作優先 (SJF)","優先權排程"],"correct_answer":"先到先服務 (FCFS)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":44,"content":{"question":"When the time quantum (q) is very large relative to the context switch time, the Round Robin (RR) algorithm''s behavior approaches [__1__].(Please answer using lowercase English letters; connect related letters with a hyphen and separate unrelated letters with a space.)","options":[],"correct_answer":"first-come first-served","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":45,"content":{"question":"迴圈排程（RR）的性能與哪些因素相關？","options":["行程類型 (CPU 密集型或 I/O 密集型)","上下文切換（context switch）的時間","程序在就緒佇列中的數量","時間片（q）的大小"],"correct_answer":"上下文切換（context switch）的時間\n程序在就緒佇列中的數量\n時間片（q）的大小","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":46,"content":{"question":"When the time quantum (TQ) is very small relative to the context switch time, what are the disadvantages of Round Robin (RR) scheduling?","options":["CPU utilization will decrease","Turnaround time will become extremely long","Response time will worsen","System overhead will be very high"],"correct_answer":"CPU utilization will decrease\nSystem overhead will be very high","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":47,"content":{"question":"RR 排程：P1 的 CPU burst 為 20、P2 為 3、P3 為 7，時間片 TQ = 4。請依序填出 A～H 八個執行區段的程序；H 之後的區段不需作答。","options":[],"correct_answer":"P1->P2->P3->P1->P3->P1->P1->P1","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":48,"content":{"question":"優先權排程的優缺點包含哪些？","options":["優先權較高的程序會先執行","可能導致飢餓問題","解決飢餓問題的方法是老化","最短作業優先 (SJF) 是優先權排程的特殊情況"],"correct_answer":"優先權較高的程序會先執行\n可能導致飢餓問題\n解決飢餓問題的方法是老化\n最短作業優先 (SJF) 是優先權排程的特殊情況","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":49,"content":{"question":"在優先權排程中，什麼問題可能導致低優先權程序永遠無法執行？","options":["護航效應","活鎖","飢餓（Starvation）","死鎖（Deadlock）"],"correct_answer":"飢餓（Starvation）","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":50,"content":{"question":"優先權排程可能會導致 ________ ，即低優先權程序永遠無法執行。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"starvation","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":51,"content":{"question":"在優先權排程中，解決「飢餓」問題的方法是什麼？","options":["增加時間量","將所有優先權設定為相同","老化 (Aging)","使用迴圈排程"],"correct_answer":"老化 (Aging)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":52,"content":{"question":"Which of the following scheduling algorithms can lead to starvation?","options":["Priority scheduling","Shortest-Job-First (SJF)","First-Come, First-Served (FCFS)","Round Robin (RR)"],"correct_answer":"Priority scheduling\nShortest-Job-First (SJF)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":53,"content":{"question":"多層級佇列（Multilevel Queue）排程的特性包含哪些？","options":["每個佇列可以有自己的排程演算法","可能導致低優先權隊列的飢餓問題","程序通常永久地固定在一個佇列中","就緒佇列被劃分為獨立的佇列"],"correct_answer":"每個佇列可以有自己的排程演算法\n可能導致低優先權隊列的飢餓問題\n程序通常永久地固定在一個佇列中\n就緒佇列被劃分為獨立的佇列","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":54,"content":{"question":"在 ________ 佇列排程中，就緒佇列被劃分為多個獨立的佇列，且程序通常永久地固定在一個佇列中。\n（請用小寫英文回答，字母間用空白）","options":[],"correct_answer":"multilevel queue","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":55,"content":{"question":"在多層級佇列（Multilevel Queue）排程中，下列哪一項敘述是正確的？","options":["程序可以在佇列之間移動","所有佇列都使用相同的排程演算法","前景佇列通常使用迴圈排程","背景佇列的優先權始終高於前景佇列"],"correct_answer":"前景佇列通常使用迴圈排程","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":56,"content":{"question":"多層級回饋佇列（Multilevel Feedback Queue）排程的定義參數包含哪些？","options":["用於確定行程進入哪個佇列的方法","佇列的數量","每個佇列的排程演算法","升級和降級程序的方法"],"correct_answer":"用於確定行程進入哪個佇列的方法\n佇列的數量\n每個佇列的排程演算法\n升級和降級程序的方法","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":57,"content":{"question":"________ 允許程序根據其服務的時間長短在不同佇列之間移動。（請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白）","options":[],"correct_answer":"multilevel feedback queue","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":58,"content":{"question":"In a ____________ scheduling, a process can move between the various queues, which helps to implement aging.(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word)","options":[],"correct_answer":"multilevel feedback queue","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":59,"content":{"question":"在多層級回饋佇列 (Multilevel Feedback Queue) 排程中，老化 (aging) 是如何實現的？","options":["通過讓程序在佇列之間移動","通過減少程序的佇列數量","透過為每個行程分配固定的時間量","通過增加等待時間"],"correct_answer":"通過讓程序在佇列之間移動","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":60,"content":{"question":"在多處理器系統中，哪種方法僅有一個處理器負責存取系統資料結構？","options":["對稱多處理（SMP）","非對稱多處理","負載平衡","處理器親和性(Processor affinity)"],"correct_answer":"非對稱多處理","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":61,"content":{"question":"在對稱多處理（SMP）中，每個處理器都 ____________ 地進行排程。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"independent","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":62,"content":{"question":"In a symmetric multiprocessing (SMP) system where each processor is self-scheduling, what is this scheduling method?","options":["Push migration","Pull migration","None of answer","Load balancing"],"correct_answer":"None of answer","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":63,"content":{"question":"CPU ____________ 是指將一個程序保持在同一處理器上執行的傾向。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"affinity","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":64,"content":{"question":"在多處理器系統中，下列哪些排程方法屬於負載平衡？","options":["處理器親和性 (Processor affinity)","拉取式遷移 (Pull migration)","對稱多處理 (SMP)","推動式遷移 (Push migration)"],"correct_answer":"拉取式遷移 (Pull migration)\n推動式遷移 (Push migration)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":65,"content":{"question":"In a symmetric multiprocessing (SMP) system, ________ is a periodic task that checks the load on each processor and pushes tasks from overloaded CPUs to other CPUs.\n(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word.)","options":[],"correct_answer":"push migration","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":66,"content":{"question":"多核心處理器的優點是什麼？","options":["更快","可以利用記憶體停頓來進行多執行緒","消耗更少電力","每個核心都有自己的專用內存"],"correct_answer":"更快\n可以利用記憶體停頓來進行多執行緒\n消耗更少電力","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":67,"content":{"question":"在多核心處理器中，利用記憶體停頓時間來推進另一個執行緒的技術是什麼？","options":["核心親和性","搶佔式調度","負載平衡","多執行緒多核心系統"],"correct_answer":"多執行緒多核心系統","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":68,"content":{"question":"在多處理器排程中， ____________ 是指只有一個處理器存取系統資料結構，從而避免了資料共享的需求。（請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白）","options":[],"correct_answer":"asymmetric multiprocessing","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":69,"content":{"question":"最早截止時間優先排程（Earliest Deadline First Scheduling）的特性是什麼？","options":["是一種靜態優先權演算法","是一種動態優先權演算法","截止時間越晚的優先權越低","截止時間越早的優先權越高"],"correct_answer":"是一種動態優先權演算法\n截止時間越晚的優先權越低\n截止時間越早的優先權越高","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":70,"content":{"question":"[__1__]排程是根據週期的倒數來分配優先權的演算法。(請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白)","options":[],"correct_answer":"rate monotonic scheduling","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":71,"content":{"question":"Hard real-time systems require a task to be serviced by its ________.","options":[],"correct_answer":"deadline","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":72,"content":{"question":"硬即時系統（Hard real-time systems）的關鍵特性是什麼？","options":["提供排程的保證","不保證排程時間","任務可以被中斷","任務必須在截止時間內完成"],"correct_answer":"任務必須在截止時間內完成","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":73,"content":{"question":"Which of the following statements about real-time scheduling are correct?","options":["The rate of a periodic task is the inverse of its period","SCHED_FIFO performs time-slicing for threads of equal priority","Hard real-time systems must provide the ability to meet deadlines","The scheduler must support preemptive, priority-based scheduling"],"correct_answer":"The rate of a periodic task is the inverse of its period\nHard real-time systems must provide the ability to meet deadlines\nThe scheduler must support preemptive, priority-based scheduling","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":74,"content":{"question":"What challenges does real-time CPU scheduling face?","options":["Dispatch latency can affect performance","Interrupt latency can affect performance","Tasks in hard real-time systems must be completed within their deadline","Soft real-time systems have no scheduling guarantee"],"correct_answer":"Dispatch latency can affect performance\nInterrupt latency can affect performance\nTasks in hard real-time systems must be completed within their deadline\nSoft real-time systems have no scheduling guarantee","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":75,"content":{"question":"從中斷到達的時間到服務該中斷的函式(ISR)開始執行的時間，這段時間被稱為？","options":["分派延遲","等待時間","中斷延遲","回應時間"],"correct_answer":"中斷延遲","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":76,"content":{"question":"What is a characteristic of SCHED_FIFO in POSIX real-time scheduling?","options":["There is no time-slicing","It provides time-slicing","It is limited to single-core systems","It provides priority boosting"],"correct_answer":"There is no time-slicing","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":77,"content":{"question":"POSIX即時排程標準中定義了哪些排程類別？","options":["SCHED_OTHER","SCHED_FIFO","SCHED_RR","SCHED_NORMAL"],"correct_answer":"SCHED_FIFO\nSCHED_RR","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":78,"content":{"question":"The POSIX.1b standard defines two scheduling classes for real-time threads: SCHED_FIFO and ____________ .(Please answer in lowercase English)","options":[],"correct_answer":"sched_rr","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":79,"content":{"question":"________ is a scheduling algorithm where priorities are assigned according to deadlines: the earlier the deadline, the higher the priority.(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word)","options":[],"correct_answer":"earliest deadline first scheduling","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":80,"content":{"question":"What are the characteristics of Rate Monotonic Scheduling?","options":["Priority is assigned based on the inverse of the period","Tasks with longer periods have lower priority","Tasks with shorter periods have higher priority","It is only suitable for hard real-time systems"],"correct_answer":"Priority is assigned based on the inverse of the period\nTasks with longer periods have lower priority\nTasks with shorter periods have higher priority","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":81,"content":{"question":"In POSIX real-time scheduling, which scheduling policy is similar to SCHED_FIFO but includes time-slicing for threads of equal priority?","options":["SCHED_OTHER","SCHED_REALTIME","SCHED_BATCH","SCHED_RR"],"correct_answer":"SCHED_RR","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":82,"content":{"question":"The [__1__] scheduling algorithm in real-time scheduling assigns priorities based on the expiration time of the data.(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word)","options":[],"correct_answer":"earliest deadline first","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":83,"content":{"question":"Linux的CFS（Completely Fair Scheduler）的目標是提供完全 ________ 的CPU分配。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"fair","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":84,"content":{"question":"完全公平排程器（CFS）有哪些特性？","options":["選擇虛擬運行時間最短的任務運行","優先權基於nice值","維護一個每個任務的虛擬運行時間（vruntime）","基於固定的時間片分配"],"correct_answer":"選擇虛擬運行時間最短的任務運行\n優先權基於nice值\n維護一個每個任務的虛擬運行時間（vruntime）","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":85,"content":{"question":"After Linux kernel version 2.6.23, what is the main scheduling algorithm?","options":["O(1) scheduler","Completely Fair Scheduler (CFS)","Priority scheduler","Standard UNIX scheduler"],"correct_answer":"Completely Fair Scheduler (CFS)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":86,"content":{"question":"在Linux核心版本2.6.23之後，排程器選擇下一個要執行的任務是基於最低的 ____________ 值。（請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白）","options":[],"correct_answer":"vruntime","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":87,"content":{"question":"Windows 排程有哪些特性？","options":["使用基於優先權的搶佔式排程","有32個優先權等級","可以提升執行緒優先權","對應每個優先權等級有一個佇列"],"correct_answer":"使用基於優先權的搶佔式排程\n有32個優先權等級\n可以提升執行緒優先權\n對應每個優先權等級有一個佇列","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":88,"content":{"question":"Windows排程器使用了 ________ 個優先級層級。(fill a number)","options":[],"correct_answer":"32","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":89,"content":{"question":"在Windows系統中，什麼是「執行緒」終止運行的原因？","options":["執行緒被阻塞","執行緒會被核心踢出","執行緒被更高優先權的執行緒搶佔","執行緒用完其時間片"],"correct_answer":"執行緒被阻塞\n執行緒被更高優先權的執行緒搶佔\n執行緒用完其時間片","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":90,"content":{"question":"In the Windows system, a thread''s priority is ________ when it returns from a waiting state.(Please answer in lowercase English)","options":[],"correct_answer":"boosted","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":91,"content":{"question":"Windows中，一個執行緒的優先權會被提升的情況有哪些？","options":["當它處於前景視窗時","當它從等待狀態返回時","當被更高優先權的執行緒搶佔時","時限（quantum）用完時"],"correct_answer":"當它處於前景視窗時\n當它從等待狀態返回時","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":92,"content":{"question":"Windows 中，下列哪些是可變（Variable）優先權類別？","options":["REALTIME_PRIORITY_CLASS","NORMAL_PRIORITY_CLASS","IDLE_PRIORITY_CLASS","HIGH_PRIORITY_CLASS"],"correct_answer":"NORMAL_PRIORITY_CLASS\nIDLE_PRIORITY_CLASS\nHIGH_PRIORITY_CLASS","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":93,"content":{"question":"在Windows排程中，哪個優先權類別的程序不能被提升優先權？","options":["HIGH_PRIORITY_CLASS","REALTIME_PRIORITY_CLASS","IDLE_PRIORITY_CLASS","NORMAL_PRIORITY_CLASS"],"correct_answer":"REALTIME_PRIORITY_CLASS","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":94,"content":{"question":"In the Windows system, threads in the ________ priority class cannot have their priority boosted.(Please answer in lowercase English, connecting letters with underscores)","options":[],"correct_answer":"realtime_priority_class","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":95,"content":{"question":"In Windows scheduling, what feature allows applications to create and manage threads independently of the kernel?","options":["User-mode scheduling (UMS)","Multilevel queue","Processor affinity","Completely Fair Scheduler"],"correct_answer":"User-mode scheduling (UMS)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":96,"content":{"question":"________ 是 Windows 7 中引入的一項功能，允許應用程式獨立於核心來創建和管理執行緒。（請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白）","options":[],"correct_answer":"user mode scheduling","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":97,"content":{"question":"在Solaris作業系統中，預設的排程類別是什麼？","options":["系統(System)","即時 (Real Time)","互動式 (Interactive)","時程共享 (Time Sharing)"],"correct_answer":"時程共享 (Time Sharing)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":98,"content":{"question":"在Solaris排程中，當多個執行緒具有相同的最高優先權時，排程器會如何處理？","options":["採用搶佔式排程","採用迴圈排程","根據執行緒創建時間進行選擇","隨機選擇一個"],"correct_answer":"採用迴圈排程","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":99,"content":{"question":"[__1__]是一個可以被系統管理員載入和設定的表格，用於管理Solaris中的多層級回饋佇列。(請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白)","options":[],"correct_answer":"dispatch table","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":100,"content":{"question":"What are the six classes of scheduling in the Solaris operating system?","options":["System","Real time","Time sharing","Interactive"],"correct_answer":"System\nReal time\nTime sharing\nInteractive","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":101,"content":{"question":"在Windows系統中，當一個執行緒的時限（quantum）用完後，它的優先權會如何？","options":["提升","降低","隨機變化","保持不變"],"correct_answer":"降低","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":102,"content":{"question":"In the Linux system, how does the nice value affect scheduling?","options":["A lower value means a higher priority","A higher value means a higher priority","A nice value of -20 corresponds to the highest priority","A nice value of +19 corresponds to the lowest priority"],"correct_answer":"A lower value means a higher priority\nA nice value of -20 corresponds to the highest priority\nA nice value of +19 corresponds to the lowest priority","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":103,"content":{"question":"____________ 模型是數學分析的工具，通常假設已知的到達和服務時間分佈。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"queueing","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":104,"content":{"question":"在排程演算法評估中，[__1__]模型通過使用概率來描述程序的到來和CPU爆發。(請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白)","options":[],"correct_answer":"queueing models","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":105,"content":{"question":"佇列模型（Queueing models）通常用來計算哪些平均值？","options":["平均等待時間","平均利用率","平均 CPU 突發時間","平均吞吐量"],"correct_answer":"平均等待時間\n平均利用率\n平均吞吐量","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":106,"content":{"question":"在排程演算法評估中，什麼方法使用預先確定的工作負載來評估每個演算法的性能？","options":["模擬","實作","佇列模型","確定性建模"],"correct_answer":"確定性建模","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":107,"content":{"question":"________ is a method for evaluating schedulers that involves creating a programmed model of a computer system and is more accurate than queueing models.(Please answer in lowercase English)","options":[],"correct_answer":"simulations","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":108,"content":{"question":"In simulations, what can be the sources of data used to drive the simulation?","options":["Mathematically or empirically defined distributions","Trace tapes of real event sequences in real systems","Fixed values input by the user","Random number generator"],"correct_answer":"Mathematically or empirically defined distributions\nTrace tapes of real event sequences in real systems\nRandom number generator","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":109,"content":{"question":"實作新排程器的缺點是什麼？","options":["在不同環境中結果可能不同","高成本","缺乏靈活性","高風險"],"correct_answer":"在不同環境中結果可能不同\n高成本\n高風險","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":110,"content":{"question":"In scheduling algorithm evaluation, what methods can be used to evaluate an algorithm?","options":["Deterministic modeling","Queueing models","Implementation","Simulations"],"correct_answer":"Deterministic modeling\nQueueing models\nImplementation\nSimulations","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":111,"content":{"question":"Little''s Formula (n = λ x W) 的特性是什麼？","options":["在穩態下，離開佇列的程序數等於到達的程序數","可以計算 CPU 使用率","適用於任何排程演算法","適用於任何到達分佈"],"correct_answer":"在穩態下，離開佇列的程序數等於到達的程序數\n適用於任何排程演算法\n適用於任何到達分佈","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":112,"content":{"question":"Proportional Share Scheduling (比例共享排程) 的特性包含什麼？","options":["這是一種動態優先權演算法","每個應用程式接收N份，其中N < T","將T份CPU時間分配給所有程序","確保每個應用程式接收到總處理器時間的N/T"],"correct_answer":"這是一種動態優先權演算法\n每個應用程式接收N份，其中N < T\n將T份CPU時間分配給所有程序\n確保每個應用程式接收到總處理器時間的N/T","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":113,"content":{"question":"虛擬化（Virtualization）環境中的排程有什麼潛在問題？","options":["可能導致不良的回應時間","可能抵消客戶端良好排程演算法的努力","虛擬機無法執行 CPU 密集型任務","可能影響客戶端 (guests) 中的時鐘"],"correct_answer":"可能導致不良的回應時間\n可能抵消客戶端良好排程演算法的努力\n可能影響客戶端 (guests) 中的時鐘","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":114,"content":{"question":"在Linux核心版本2.6.23之後，主要的排程器演算法是什麼？","options":["標準UNIX排程器","完全公平排程器 (CFS)","優先權排程器","O(1)排程器"],"correct_answer":"完全公平排程器 (CFS)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":115,"content":{"question":"分派器（Dispatcher）模組的工作包含哪些項目？","options":["選擇下一個要運行的行程","切換到使用者模式","切換上下文 (context switch)","跳轉到使用者程式中的正確位置以重新啟動該程式"],"correct_answer":"切換到使用者模式\n切換上下文 (context switch)\n跳轉到使用者程式中的正確位置以重新啟動該程式","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":116,"content":{"question":"POSIX.1b標準定義了兩種即時排程類別：SCHED_FIFO和 ________ 。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"sched_rr","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":117,"content":{"question":"In Multilevel Queue scheduling, which of the following statements is correct?","options":["The foreground queue typically uses Round Robin scheduling","A process can move between the queues","The background queue always has a higher priority than the foreground queue","All queues use the same scheduling algorithm"],"correct_answer":"The foreground queue typically uses Round Robin scheduling","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":118,"content":{"question":"在 POSIX 即時排程中，SCHED_FIFO 的特點是什麼？","options":["沒有時間分片","提供時間分片","僅限於單核心系統","提供優先提升"],"correct_answer":"沒有時間分片","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":119,"content":{"question":"下列哪些關於即時排程的敘述是正確的？","options":["週期性任務的速率是其週期的倒數","硬即時系統必須提供滿足截止日期的能力","排程器必須支援搶佔式、基於優先權的排程","SCHED_FIFO 對相同優先權的執行緒進行時間片分配"],"correct_answer":"週期性任務的速率是其週期的倒數\n硬即時系統必須提供滿足截止日期的能力\n排程器必須支援搶佔式、基於優先權的排程","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":120,"content":{"question":"What are the pros and cons of priority scheduling?","options":["Higher-priority processes will execute first","The solution to starvation is aging","SJF is a special case of priority scheduling","It can lead to the starvation problem"],"correct_answer":"Higher-priority processes will execute first\nThe solution to starvation is aging\nSJF is a special case of priority scheduling\nIt can lead to the starvation problem","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":121,"content":{"question":"當時間片（q）相對於上下文切換時間非常大時，迴圈排程（RR）演算法的行為會趨近於 ____________。（請用小寫英文回答 關聯字母間用-連接 非關聯字母間用 空白）","options":[],"correct_answer":"first-come first-served","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":122,"content":{"question":"在Windows排程中，哪個功能允許應用程式獨立於核心來創建和管理執行緒？","options":["處理器親和性","多層級佇列","完全公平排程器","使用者模式排程 (UMS)"],"correct_answer":"使用者模式排程 (UMS)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":123,"content":{"question":"Linux在核心版本2.5中採用的O(1)排程器有哪些特性？","options":["搶佔式","基於優先權","有兩個優先權範圍:時程共享和即時","所有任務都放在一個佇列中"],"correct_answer":"搶佔式\n基於優先權\n有兩個優先權範圍:時程共享和即時","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":124,"content":{"question":"In a multiprocessor system, which of the following scheduling methods are part of load balancing?","options":["Pull migration","Symmetric multiprocessing (SMP)","Push migration","Processor affinity"],"correct_answer":"Pull migration\nPush migration","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":125,"content":{"question":"當一個程序從運行狀態切換到等待狀態時，CPU 排程器會被 ________。\n（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"wakeup","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":126,"content":{"question":"Which of the following is a task of the Dispatcher?","options":["Giving control of the CPU to the process selected by the scheduler","Transitioning a process from a waiting to a ready state","Removing a process from the ready queue","Sending an interrupt to a process"],"correct_answer":"Giving control of the CPU to the process selected by the scheduler","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":128,"content":{"question":"In Windows, which of the following are Variable priority classes?","options":["HIGH_PRIORITY_CLASS","IDLE_PRIORITY_CLASS","REALTIME_PRIORITY_CLASS","NORMAL_PRIORITY_CLASS"],"correct_answer":"HIGH_PRIORITY_CLASS\nIDLE_PRIORITY_CLASS\nNORMAL_PRIORITY_CLASS","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":129,"content":{"question":"速率單調排程（Rate Monotonic Scheduling）的特性是什麼？","options":["週期越長的任務優先權越低","僅適用於硬即時系統","週期越短的任務優先權越高","根據週期的倒數來分配優先權"],"correct_answer":"週期越長的任務優先權越低\n週期越短的任務優先權越高\n根據週期的倒數來分配優先權","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":130,"content":{"question":"在 ________ 排程中，程序可以在不同的佇列之間移動，這有助於實現老化。（請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白）","options":[],"correct_answer":"multilevel feedback queue","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":131,"content":{"question":"下列哪些是排程演算法的優化目標？","options":["最小化周轉時間","最小化回應時間","最大化CPU利用率","最大化吞吐量"],"correct_answer":"最小化周轉時間\n最小化回應時間\n最大化CPU利用率\n最大化吞吐量","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":132,"content":{"question":"In multiple-processor scheduling, ________ is where only one processor accesses the system data structures, alleviating the need for data sharing.(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word)","options":[],"correct_answer":"asymmetric multiprocessing","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":134,"content":{"question":"在Windows系統中，當一個執行緒從等待狀態返回時，它的優先權會被 ____________。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"boosted","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":135,"content":{"question":"In a multiprocessor system, which approach involves only one processor accessing the system data structures?","options":["Asymmetric multiprocessing","Load balancing","Symmetric multiprocessing (SMP)","Processor affinity"],"correct_answer":"Asymmetric multiprocessing","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":136,"content":{"question":"In priority scheduling, the solution to the \"starvation\" problem where a low-priority process might never execute is ________ .(Please answer in lowercase English)","options":[],"correct_answer":"aging","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":137,"content":{"question":"In multicore processors, what technique takes advantage of memory stall to make progress on another thread?","options":["Core affinity","Load balancing","Preemptive scheduling","Multithreaded multicore system"],"correct_answer":"Multithreaded multicore system","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":138,"content":{"question":"Shortest-remaining-time-first (SRTF) is the preemptive version of which scheduling algorithm?","options":["Round Robin (RR)","First-Come, First-Served (FCFS)","Priority scheduling","Shortest-Job-First (SJF)"],"correct_answer":"Shortest-Job-First (SJF)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":139,"content":{"question":"What averages are typically computed using queueing models?","options":["Average utilization","Average waiting time","Average throughput","Average CPU burst time"],"correct_answer":"Average utilization\nAverage waiting time\nAverage throughput","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":140,"content":{"question":"Solaris作業系統的排程有哪些六個類別？","options":["時程共享（Time sharing）","系統(System)","即時（Real time）","互動式（Interactive）"],"correct_answer":"時程共享（Time sharing）\n系統(System)\n即時（Real time）\n互動式（Interactive）","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":141,"content":{"question":"CPU-I/O 連發週期是程序執行中，CPU 連發接著 ________ 連發的循環。\n（請用英文大寫字母）","options":[],"correct_answer":"I/O","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":142,"content":{"question":"在模擬（Simulations）中，用於驅動模擬的資料來源可以是哪些？","options":["使用者輸入固定值","隨機數產生器","真實系統中事件序列的追蹤帶","數學或經驗定義的分佈"],"correct_answer":"隨機數產生器\n真實系統中事件序列的追蹤帶\n數學或經驗定義的分佈","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":143,"content":{"question":"What are the characteristics of the O(1) scheduler adopted by Linux in kernel version 2.5?","options":["Priority-based","It has two priority ranges: time-sharing and real-time","All tasks are placed in a single queue","Preemptive"],"correct_answer":"Priority-based\nIt has two priority ranges: time-sharing and real-time\nPreemptive","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":144,"content":{"question":"____________ 是一種評估排程器的方法，它透過建立一個電腦系統的程式化模型來進行，比佇列模型更準確。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"simulations","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":145,"content":{"question":"In a CPU-I/O cycle, what does process execution consist of?","options":["An alternating cycle of CPU bursts and I/O bursts","Continuous access to data blocks","Only I/O waits","Only CPU bursts"],"correct_answer":"An alternating cycle of CPU bursts and I/O bursts","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":146,"content":{"question":"What are the defining parameters of a Multilevel Feedback Queue scheduler?","options":["The method used to determine which queue a process will enter","The number of queues","The scheduling algorithm for each queue","The method used to upgrade and demote a process"],"correct_answer":"The method used to determine which queue a process will enter\nThe number of queues\nThe scheduling algorithm for each queue\nThe method used to upgrade and demote a process","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":147,"content":{"question":"硬即時系統（Hard real-time systems）要求任務必須在 ________ 內完成。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"deadline","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":149,"content":{"question":"迴圈排程（RR）演算法中，每個程序獲得一小段CPU時間的單位稱為 ________ 。（請用小寫英文回答，單字間留一個空白）","options":[],"correct_answer":"time quantum","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":150,"content":{"question":"________ 排程演算法因為其簡潔性而被廣泛使用，但可能導致「護航效應」。\n（請用小寫英文回答全名，字母間用 - 連接）","options":[],"correct_answer":"first-come first-served","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":151,"content":{"question":"When a process switches from a running to a ready state, the scheduling is of the ________ type. (Please answer in lowercase English)","options":[],"correct_answer":"preemptive","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":152,"content":{"question":"What are the disadvantages of implementing a new scheduler?","options":["Results may vary in different environments","Lack of flexibility","High cost","High risk"],"correct_answer":"Results may vary in different environments\nHigh cost\nHigh risk","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":153,"content":{"question":"Which of the following are criteria for evaluating CPU scheduling algorithms?","options":["Throughput","Waiting time","Turnaround time","CPU utilization"],"correct_answer":"Throughput\nWaiting time\nTurnaround time\nCPU utilization","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":155,"content":{"question":"In scheduling algorithm evaluation, ____________ describe the arrival of processes and CPU bursts probabilistically.(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word)","options":[],"correct_answer":"queueing models","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":156,"content":{"question":"________ models are a mathematical analysis tool that usually assume known arrival and service time distributions. (Please answer in lowercase English)","options":[],"correct_answer":"queueing","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":157,"content":{"question":"________ 效應是指一個短程序被一個或多個長程序阻塞。（請用小寫英文回答）","options":[],"correct_answer":"convoy","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":158,"content":{"question":"Throughput is the number of ____________ completed per time unit.(Please answer in lowercase English)","options":[],"correct_answer":"process","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":159,"content":{"question":"在對稱多處理（SMP）系統中，每個處理器都自我排程，這是哪種排程方法？","options":["拉取式遷移 (Pull migration)","推動式遷移 (Push migration)","都不是","負載平衡"],"correct_answer":"都不是","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":160,"content":{"question":"在排程演算法評估中，有哪些方法可以被用來評估演算法？","options":["佇列模型","模擬","確定性建模","實作"],"correct_answer":"佇列模型\n模擬\n確定性建模\n實作","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":161,"content":{"question":"____________ 是根據截止時間分配優先權的演算法：截止時間越早，優先權越高。（請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白）","options":[],"correct_answer":"earliest deadline first scheduling","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":162,"content":{"question":"In Symmetric Multiprocessing (SMP), each processor ________ schedules itself.(Please answer in lowercase English)","options":[],"correct_answer":"independent","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":163,"content":{"question":"Process Burst Time P1 20 P2 3 P3 7 Use Round Robin (RR) to schedule the above process. The following is the process of scheduling time from left to right (A to H represent the processed block H. There may be a schedule after the block, which is ignored because it is not in the question to be asked. Do not show)\n圖中執行區塊：A、B、C、D、E、F、G、H\n圖中時間邊界：I、J、K、L、M、N、O、P、Q\nIf TQ = 4, what is the order of A~H? Answer format: P0->P2->P4->P6->P5->P6 Format errors do not count\n________","options":[],"correct_answer":"P1->P2->P3->P1->P3->P1->P1->P1","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":164,"content":{"question":"Which scheduling classes are defined in the POSIX real-time scheduling standard?","options":["SCHED_FIFO","SCHED_RR","SCHED_NORMAL","SCHED_OTHER"],"correct_answer":"SCHED_FIFO\nSCHED_RR","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":165,"content":{"question":"What is a key characteristic of hard real-time systems?","options":["They provide guarantees for scheduling","They do not guarantee scheduling time","A task must be serviced by its deadline","A task can be interrupted"],"correct_answer":"A task must be serviced by its deadline","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":166,"content":{"question":"哪一個排程演算法會導致「護航效應」（convoy effect）？","options":["短工作優先 (SJF)","先到先服務 (FCFS)","輪轉 (RR)","優先權排程"],"correct_answer":"先到先服務 (FCFS)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":167,"content":{"question":"Response time is the time from request submission to the first ________ produced.(Please answer in lowercase English)","options":[],"correct_answer":"response","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":168,"content":{"question":"短剩餘時間優先（SRTF）是 ________ 排程演算法的搶佔式版本。\n（請用小寫英文回答，字母間用 - 連接）","options":[],"correct_answer":"shortest-job-first","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":169,"content":{"question":"當一個程序從「執行中」狀態切換到「等待中」狀態時，排程決策屬於哪種類型？","options":["無關","搶佔式","中斷式","非搶佔式"],"correct_answer":"非搶佔式","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":170,"content":{"question":"What are the advantages of Shortest-Job-First (SJF) scheduling?","options":["Can predict the length of the next CPU burst","Minimum average waiting time for a given set of processes","Suitable for real-time systems","Easy to implement"],"correct_answer":"Minimum average waiting time for a given set of processes","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":171,"content":{"question":"CPU scheduling decisions typically take place under which of the following circumstances?","options":["A process terminates","A process switches from the waiting to the ready state","A process switches from the running to the waiting state","A process switches from the running to the ready state"],"correct_answer":"A process terminates\nA process switches from the waiting to the ready state\nA process switches from the running to the waiting state\nA process switches from the running to the ready state","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":173,"content":{"question":"A ____________ is a loadable table in Solaris that can be configured by a system administrator to manage the multilevel feedback queue.(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word)","options":[],"correct_answer":"dispatch table","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":174,"content":{"question":"What are the characteristics of the Completely Fair Scheduler (CFS)?","options":["Priority is based on the nice value","It maintains a per-task virtual run time (vruntime)","It is based on fixed time-quantum allotments","It selects the task with the lowest virtual run time to run"],"correct_answer":"Priority is based on the nice value\nIt maintains a per-task virtual run time (vruntime)\nIt selects the task with the lowest virtual run time to run","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":175,"content":{"question":"____________ 排程演算法是最佳的，因為它能給定程序集提供最小的平均等待時間。（請用小寫英文回答 字母間用-連接）","options":[],"correct_answer":"shortest-job-first","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":176,"content":{"question":"即時CPU排程面臨哪些挑戰？","options":["硬即時系統的任務必須在截止時間內完成","中斷延遲會影響性能","配置(Dispatch)延遲會影響效能","軟體實時系統沒有排程保證"],"correct_answer":"硬即時系統的任務必須在截止時間內完成\n中斷延遲會影響性能\n配置(Dispatch)延遲會影響效能\n軟體實時系統沒有排程保證","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":177,"content":{"question":"在POSIX即時排程中，哪種排程策略與SCHED_FIFO相似，但對相同優先權的執行緒有時間分片？","options":["SCHED_REALTIME","SCHED_BATCH","SCHED_OTHER","SCHED_RR"],"correct_answer":"SCHED_RR","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":178,"content":{"question":"____________ is the \\lambda in Little''s Formula (n = \\lambda \\times W), representing the average arrival rate into the queue.(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word)","options":[],"correct_answer":"average arrival rate","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":179,"content":{"question":"Process execution consists of a cycle of CPU execution and I/O wait, which is known as a cpu-i/o ____________ .(請用小寫英文回答 字母間留一個空白)","options":[],"correct_answer":"burst cycle","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":180,"content":{"question":"在 Linux 系統中，nice 值如何影響排程？","options":["數值越低代表優先權越高","-20的nice值對應最高的優先權","nice 值 +19 對應最低優先權","數值越高代表優先權越高"],"correct_answer":"數值越低代表優先權越高\n-20的nice值對應最高的優先權\nnice 值 +19 對應最低優先權","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":181,"content":{"question":"In the Round Robin scheduling algorithm, the ____________ determines the length of CPU time each process gets.(Please answer in lowercase English, leaving a space between each word)","options":[],"correct_answer":"time quantum","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":182,"content":{"question":"What are the characteristics of Earliest Deadline First (EDF) Scheduling?","options":["The earlier the deadline, the higher the priority","It is a dynamic priority algorithm","The later the deadline, the lower the priority","It is a static priority algorithm"],"correct_answer":"The earlier the deadline, the higher the priority\nIt is a dynamic priority algorithm\nThe later the deadline, the lower the priority","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":184,"content":{"question":"In the Windows system, what happens to a thread''s priority when its quantum expires?","options":["It 